    "description": "the funnel-stage vocabulary. 10 stages where a piece of customer-facing copy can fire. Each key is the canonical stage ID; value is a list of alias strings the parser searches in raw text + tactic names to auto-tag rows / cocktails / canon principles with the stages they apply to.",
    "edit_instructions": "Edit this file directly. After any change, run `python3 tools/marketing_brain.py rebuild-index` to refresh the SQLite index + JSON cache. Add a new stage by adding a new key under `vocab`. Add a new alias by appending to the existing list. The Brain matches aliases case-insensitively as substrings.",
